FORM|text=The commands below are the measured commands of each manifest row with this repository's paths put in. Two things differ from the 2026-10-17 runs: stage_office.py reads the 4 qr files from $QR and prior3174.bin from this repository, and it checks each against the same sha256 it checked then (stage_office.py KNOWN), so the staged bytes are the same; and a program that is in this repository with its run commit's sha256 is copied from here instead of from $H. No row was re-run in this form when this file was written; every row is UNVERIFIED in this form, and what was measured is what its manifest row records|json=0
